<title>UK: COCA-COLA AMATIL SETS $200 MLN SIX-YEAR EUROBOND.</title>
<headline>COCA-COLA AMATIL SETS $200 MLN SIX-YEAR EUROBOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley Dean Witter.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COCA-COLA AMATIL</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    04.SEP.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.449   PAY DATE    04.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.899    SPREAD	+33 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 31.JUL.02</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
